rgb_reports/progress_note_selfperception.md:287: [FACT-MAJOR] 1.89/0.70 are persona-direction gain-sweep numbers (max trait at intact text), NOT delta-steering. Delta injection: Llama +1.85 at alpha=2 (~= its persona vector's +1.75) vs Qwen +0.21 — 12x gap at matched norm and indistinguishable spectral placement. Rewrite with delta numbers or re-scope the sentence to persona-vector steering
